    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the problem is there is no \"taking a break\" with this kind of life. if i step away for a week, the whole thing just collapses. everyone is depending on me to keep this machine running. it's not just a job, it's my entire identity and i hate it. i just want the noise to stop. i want everything to just go silent.",
